sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant M as mbarrier(slot,g)
    participant T as TMA engine
    participant C as Consumer

    P->>M: arrive + expect bytes
    P->>T: issue k to S[slot,g]
    Note over P,T: producer continues independent work
    T->>T: copy to shared
    T-->>M: repay tracked bytes
    C->>M: wait token/parity g
    M-->>C: phase g complete
    C->>C: acquire then read
